# Install as /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/00-ghostfleet-admin.conf
# OpenSSH generally keeps the first value obtained. This early filename helps,
# but does not guarantee precedence over another earlier drop-in or Match rule.
# Always run scripts/verify-sshd-admin.sh against the effective sshd config.
# Add the owner's public key to /root/.ssh/authorized_keys first.
# No ForceCommand, command= restriction or per-command gate is configured.

PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
AuthenticationMethods publickey
